id: pm-p5u6
title: "Bound local temp footprint: prune Node compile cache and guarantee smoke/dogfood sandbox cleanup on failure"
description: "ecosystem review 2026-07-06 hit a full /tmp user quota (tmpfs usrquota, EDQUOT) that broke the local agent shell entirely. Post-mortem inventory: pm-cli-node-compile-cache-1000 had grown to 1.7GB (src/cli.ts enableCompileCache never prunes; every build hash accumulates), plus ~2GB of leaked pm-scaffold-review*-smoke-* dirs and 7 pm-changelog-node-cli-* dirs from Jun 29-30 sessions whose scripts mkdtemp'd but did not clean on failure/interrupt. smoke-cleanup.mjs cleanupTempRoot is only wired into smoke-npx-from-pack.mjs."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[5]: "area:cli",dx,perf,scripts,tech-debt
created_at: "2026-07-06T09:04:36.860Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-07T19:53:33.438Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-07T19:53:32.711Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-07T19:53:32.711Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: compile-cache dir bounded (stale entries pruned or non-current versions dropped); every mkdtemp-using script cleans its sandbox via try/finally + signal handlers; aborted smoke runs leave no >100MB residue in /tmp
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Added compatible SDK parent-preserving atomic writes and locks; detached telemetry uses existing configuration without recreating roots; eight remaining release and benchmark producers register ownership, cancel stages, await child closure and clean up in finally. Unsettled shutdown retains the workspace with a diagnostic. Shared lifecycle documentation and public SDK receipts updated."
expected_result: Owned temporary storage remains absent after deletion; foreground defaults remain compatible; producers release settled workspaces and preserve unfinished work safely.
actual_result: "Full sandboxed suite passed 9,897 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; 280 linked lifecycle/producer cases and packed continuation acceptance passed. Real event/OTLP HTTP, native child closure and SIGTERM exercised deletion and bounded retention; isolated actual shipping artifact passed npm/npx and Bun/bunx. All four historical child items remain closed."
